// `StaticSpec.AddedCost` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). `times` is how often the cost may be
// paid, `Once` unless written: squad's "any number of times" [CR#702.157a].
(
    name: "addedCost",
    kinds: [StaticSpec],
    params: {"cost": Cost, "offered": Any, "times": Default(Any, Once)},
    body: AddedCost(cost: Param(cost), offered: Param(offered), times: Param(times)),
)
